</div>
<p><!--- END TREATMENT --></p>
<p><!--- START DVO TREATMENT --></p>
<div class="card col-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3 border-0 float-start p-3">
<div class="card-header bg-dark ps-2 pe-2 ps-lg-4"><a class="card-title text-light" href="/justice-court/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2026/06/Q2-2026-DVOT-Provider-List.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DV Treatment</a></div>
<div class="card-body p-0"><a href="/justice-court/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2026/06/Q2-2026-DVOT-Provider-List.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" data-src="https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card.jpg.webp" alt="Four people joining hands together in a circle over a table." width="100%" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" class="lazyload" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 1920px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1920/1920;" data-srcset="https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card.jpg.webp 1920w, https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card-1024x1024.jpg.webp 1024w, https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card-768x768.jpg.webp 768w, https://www.springvilleutah.gov/justice-court/wp-content/smush-webp/sites/9/2026/06/DVOT-Card-1536x1536.jpg.webp 1536w" data-sizes="auto" data-original-sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px"></a></div>
</div>
<p><!--- END DVO TREATMENT --></p>
